  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enable Sida to follow up whether Convictus Ukraine is able to      fulfil their contractual obligations vis-&#xe0;-vis Sida, this             systems-based audit follow-up of the organisation will be made, with  an emphasis on financial system, control, procurement. Through this   intervention capacity of Convictus Ukraine will be built, so that it  can apply for other donors funding after Sida phases out its support.</narrative>
